  "2026-10-29T18:56:19.065Z",codex-agent,"Audit confirms no pending-version section despite merged PRs 274, 276 and 278 with successful CI. Their three feature items and the exact-span SDK follow-up implemented in PR 278 remain in_progress. Append-only updates close only those verified deliveries and pin 2026.10.29; the native backwards-history paging follow-up remains open. No hosted services, runtime configuration, version or workflow changes."
  "2026-10-29T19:09:15.628Z",codex-agent,"The repository generator now emits the exact 2026.10.29 - 2026-10-29 section with the verified deliveries from PRs 274, 276 and 278, including the implemented exact-span SDK follow-up. Version, dependency pins, workflows and runtime configuration are unchanged. Fresh build passes with no dist drift. Linked npm run changelog:check is the native reproducibility check; full npm/Bun release gates require fresh CI with its isolated PostgreSQL service at unchanged thresholds. No hosted data, Docker or service was accessed. Origin/main lacks the heading; only lifecycle and release metadata repair makes the repository command emit it."
